abstract: >-
  Gemma 3 270M trained to play Wordle through text on free Kaggle GPUs. With word-level decoding the final model wins
  97.0% of WordleBench games, 96.0% of Jeffers games and 98.6% of 500 TextArena games; alone, under the leaderboards'
  own rule, it wins 94.0% of WordleBench games. The repository holds the code, the frozen word lists, every evaluation
  summary and the paper source.
